# Design System

Use semantic tokens from `app/globals.css` — `bg-primary`, `text-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`. Do not introduce ad hoc hex colors.

## Surfaces

| Surface | Shell |
|---------|-------|
| Public | `MainHeader` + `MainFooter`, `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8` |
| Auth | `AuthPageShell` + `AuthFormPanel` + `AuthFormTitle` |
| Admin / customer | Route-group layout + sidenav |

## Typography

- **Public** (landing, marketing): default sans (`inter` via root layout). Headings use weight/scale only — `text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl` for heroes; do not use `lusitana`.
- **Admin / customer**: page `h1` with `lusitana` from `@/app/fonts`.
- **Auth**: titles via `AuthFormTitle` (`lusitana`).

## Components

- Primitives: `@/components/ui/*` (shadcn new-york)
- Shared: `components/shared/`, `components/layout/`
- Route UI: `app/.../_components/`

## Copy

Spanish (es-AR). Voseo on public/auth (`Ingresá`, `Completá`); neutral labels on admin forms.

## Accessibility (baseline)

- Every form control has a visible label (`Label` + `htmlFor`, or `label` + `id`).
- Icon-only buttons must include `aria-label` (Spanish).
- Decorative icons: `aria-hidden="true"`.
- Do not remove focus outlines; use `focus-visible:ring-*` on custom controls.

Full patterns: **ui-design** skill → `a11y-reference.md`.

